Package: AURAkNN
Title: Accelerated Ultra-rapid R Architecture for k-NN imputation
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Michał", "Kalwas", role = c("aut", "cre"),email="michal.kalwas.stud@pw.edu.pl")
Author: Michał Kalwas [aut,cre]
Maintainer: Michał Kalwas <michal.kalwas.stud@pw.edu.pl>
Description: AURAkNN implements high-performance k-Nearest Neighbors (kNN) imputation algorithm. It features a highly optimized C backend with OpenMP multithreading, supporting Euclidean, Manhattan, and Gower distances, and operates in two distinct modes: fast and precise.
